Randyverse
==========

Randyverse is a white-label distribution of PyGPT.

Original project: PyGPT — Desktop AI Assistant
Original author:  Marcin Szczyglinski
Source:           https://github.com/szczyglis-dev/py-gpt
License:          MIT License

The original MIT license text and copyright notice are retained in the
LICENSE file, as required by the license terms.

All "Randyverse" branding (name, logos, icons, splash artwork) in this
distribution replaces the original PyGPT branding.
